 וגם:
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
0 & =a\cdot0=a\cdot\left(1+1\right)=a\cdot1+a\cdot1=a+a\\
0 & =b\cdot0=b\cdot\left(1+1\right)=b\cdot1+b\cdot1=b+b
\end{align*}

\end_inset

כלומר 
\begin_inset Formula $-a=a$
